# This repo only tracks the Agent Pay monorepo folders and root docs.
# Everything else on this machine's Desktop is deliberately excluded:
# ignore everything by default, then explicitly allow the project paths.
/*

!/AgnetPay/
!/agentpay_backend/
!/agent_pay_vault/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/.gitignore

# Each project folder has its own .gitignore for its internal exclusions
# (env files, wallets/keypairs, build artifacts, caches, demo state).
